  "description": "The Enigma is the Paradox’s playful sibling. Similar DNA, yet with a wild side. Based around a 27.5 rear wheel, it’s a really versatile, jack of all trades hardtail. The Enigma can be set up as a mid travel 27.5 (140-160mm 27.5” fork) or as a short travel mullet (100-130mm 29” fork). This is the perfect frame for those who want a high performance hardtail to take on anything from all day epics to the local pumptrack and jump spot, it loves it all.\nThe Enigma utilizes Banshee’s engineered vertical compliance and vibration damping achieved through clever FEA optimized forgings. The Enigma is beyond your average hardtail. It offers a truly unique and joyous ride quality that will put a huge smile on your face.",
